    "notes": [
      "International car configuration retains the complete northern course, northeastern extension, central hairpin and southern main straight. Exact 2018 public coordinates give 4,081.6 m; the operator identifies a 4,085 m car circuit. Western junction chicanes, pit-lane way 48683141, club closing alternatives and the separate training center are excluded. The 2020 licensed regional orthophoto confirms the paved course. Exact source coordinates are unchanged; historical alignment and direction remain provisional."
